{"id":"705cd151c71b2488","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure.md","title":"正则语言的同态与逆同态封闭性","display":"thm-regular-homomorphism-closure — 正则语言的同态与逆同态封闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure","aliases":["73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure"],"display":"thm-regular-homomorphism-closure — 正则语言的同态与逆同态封闭性","depends_on":["[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-thm-regular-substitution-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 3.5, p. 61; scan 69","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-homomorphism-closure — 正则语言的同态与逆同态封闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92da433aceb4e9e5\" href=\"?note=92da433aceb4e9e5\" title=\"73-thm-regular-substitution-closure\">73-thm-regular-substitution-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.2, print pp. 133–149; PDF pp. 155–171; local closure formulation or corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 3.5, p. 61; scan 69"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\">\\(h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\">\\(K\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\\)</span>。DFA 语言语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}homomorphism\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nh[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\\land h^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}homomorphism\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nh[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\\land h^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向由单元素代换得到。逆向在 K 的 DFA 上令新转移 δ′(q,a)=δ̂(q,h(〈a〉))；对词长归纳得到 δ̂′(q,w)=δ̂(q,h(w))，因此接受语言正是原像。擦除字母时仍成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-regular-substitution-closure","status":"resolved","id":"92da433aceb4e9e5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-substitution-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)$，见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$、$K\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}$。DFA 语言语义见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)$，见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$、$K\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}$。DFA 语言语义见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}homomorphism\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nh[L]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Delta}\\land h^{-1}[K]\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":true}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure|正则语言的同态与逆同态封闭性]]"},{"id":"a71477b615860172","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-standard-language-families]] 的族对象及 [[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]] 的封闭谓词。相关具体封闭见 [[73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure]]、[[73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism]]、[[73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure]]。$\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L$。"}],"outgoing":["85832410fcdc9965","c284ffb568a496fd","3b7a967565c86f39","92da433aceb4e9e5"]}